Guest stars: Lim Kay Siu and Kumar.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tMyAXImYSJPgAygfPUjOKY9r9AL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2006-11-28\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Crazy like a horse\",\"overview\":\"Chu Kang renovates the toilet at Crazy Horse and ends up onstage with the dancers. Guest stars Brian Richmond and the Crazy Horse dancers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wu4VCPwzOIyuvCORvRNAZk8eBKp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-05\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Incredulous tale\",\"overview\":\"UTT from Incredible Tales introduces an incredible tale about Chu Kang and Rosie by bringing home a mysterious unconscious woman who may not be what she appears. Sergeant Dollah (Suhaimi Yusof) from Police and Thief investigates.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lIabdaRDUXAcjwNShR5SZRDIfTA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-12\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Under another roof\",\"overview\":\"Chu Kang reunites with former clients Tan Ah Teck and Dolly. Guest stars Moses Lim, Koh Cheng Mun and Jocelyn Yeo.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jJYGNi1ASh3nxaWFB98iWU5G1eL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-19\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"VR man\",\"overview\":\"Chu Kang plays a virtual reality game and is transformed into a CG version of himself while Rosie cannot stop eating hay bee hiam and gets a monstrous sore throat.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e2KUcx3qQV3EN62DG5fblb0qX6f.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2006-12-26\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Dark side of the loon\",\"overview\":\"To get Rosie's mother Ah Loon (Wendy Ng) out of his house, Chu Kang has to go to a KTV lounge to persuade his very drunk father-in-law (Henry Thia) to return to her. Margaret thinks her old friend Leslie (Vernon A) is casting her in his new play.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aTk2uckse4Sp21GUSdPbkRaVTHQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-09\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"To all the girls\",\"overview\":\"Kingkong is depressed as he does not have a girlfriend. The others try to cheer him up by reminiscing about their past amourous encounters.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m7xCtzvNBY5yWG9ffSBuwpav11H.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Skit contest special\",\"overview\":\"In this skit contest episode, viewers get to watch the five skits that were written by viewers -'Kingkong's Job Interview',\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bNYYdTLmtB8z6t2uiipDw1QHTO4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2007-01-30\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Return of the kin\",\"overview\":\"A mysterious woman who claims to be Chu Kang's 'aunt' creates tension in the family as he prepares to celebrate the twins' first birthday and tries to impress a potential new client. Guest stars Neo Swee Lin and Carole Lin.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k3m5lZYknyVxcTRjGU7RAe8W5oO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-06\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Best in Singapore and JB finale\",\"overview\":\"In this 90-min special, Adrian Pang hosts a series of wrap party that includes the final episode of Singapore's longest running sitcom, a chat with the cast themselves and other surprises. Guest stars Neo Swee Lin and Lim Kay Siu.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zqEqcrPDjKJGl9CR93bi41VD3xj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2007-02-11\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"1997-09-25\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}